title: "NVCR: Native runtime architecture for neural video codecs"
abstract: >-
  NVCR provides a native C++ runtime architecture for neural video codecs,
  including stateful sessions, codec/provider contracts, target-aware artifact
  resolution, bounded access units, and reproducible validation tooling.
